        "notes": "In round 3 we will choose  [Hyper Healer](item_108336b3-54d2-4d69-8ea4-c2da5affb7ca) for our power. Despite the nerfs this ability is still good as it basically gives you a free instant heal that doesn't disrupt the flow of your other abilities.\n\nRemember the ring bonus is applied when the ability passes through people, they do not need to go through the ring after it's deployed to get the extra health. However they can walk through it again after the [Overhealth] has expired for an extra 75 health.\n\nWe will also pick up our first Epic:  [Biotech Maximizer](item_01c6dcb3-d2e2-4c57-bd21-61d7b8f939c4) . While it's not technically a [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction) it can help reduce Pulsar Torpedoes by 20%. 25% if Ashe's Bob is in play. 30% if Bob and Kiriko's clone are in play! \ud83c\udf20\ud83c\udf20\ud83c\udf20\ud83c\udf20\ud83c\udf20\ud83c\udf20",
