        "created_at": "2025-07-24T00:10:28.965082+00:00",
        "notes": "In the final round you have a choice.\n\n[Rally Ring](item_0547012b-4817-437e-aad3-aa37db93383e) is the preferred choice as it reduces your Hyper Ring cool down by an extra 4 seconds if you shoot it through your whole team.\n\n [Medicinal Missiles](item_30eeab6c-4a1e-4a16-b9dd-e83d633caa40) is good if you have a strong second healer like  [Mercy](hero_0e213bfc-3ca9-49c6-9036-e7f344b752da) or  [Moira](hero_7fb6ff1e-a193-40c0-bd0a-25c1928fbaed) and you want to focus more on healing\n\n [Torpedo Glide](item_b04180a3-c2b2-409c-959e-77e3af6bc7d8) can let you shoot off Pulsar Torpedoes constantly, but it's extra work and the glide makes you more vulnerable.\n\nAs mentioned last round we will round off the build with [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) giving us a full 40% cooldown reduction!\n\nIf you are behind on cash here you can take  [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) or  [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) instead.\n\nAt this point you should have Hyper Ring and Pulsar Torpedoes down to every 6 seconds!",
